      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URehobowamu waya eShekema ngoba bonke abakoIsrayeli babeye khona ukumbeka abe yinkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uJerobowamu indodana kaNebati ekuzwa lokhu, wabuya evela eGibithe, ngoba wayelokhu eseGibithe lapho ayebalekele khona, ebalekela inkosi uSolomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli beza bathi kuRehobowamu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyihlo wasithwalisa umthwalo onzima; wenake ake uphungule ubunzima asethwesa bona, wethule lemithwalo abesithwalise yona, ng’khona sizakukukhonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi kibo: Buyani futhi emva kwensuku ezintathu. Basebehambake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uRehobowamu yasicebisana labadala ababeloyise uSolomoni esaphila, yathi: Lithi angithini kulababantu na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathi: Uba uzakuba yinceku yalababantu lamhla ubakhonze, ukhulume kibo amazwi amahle nxa ubaphendula, bazakuba zinceku zakho kokuphela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yena wasidelela iseluleko sabadala, wacebisana lamajaha ayeyintanga yakhe, ayesizana laye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuwo: Lithi sibaphendule sithini lababantu abathe kimi: Ake uphungule ubunzima esabethweswa nguyihlo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amajaha ayeyintanga yakhe athi: Uzakutsho kulababantu abathi kuwe: Uyihlo wasethwesa ubunzima, kodwa akusiphungulele bona; uthi kibo: Ucikilicane wami uqatha kulokhalo lukababa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubaba walethwesa ubunzima, mina ngizakwengezelela kubo. Ubaba walitshaya ngesiswepu, kodwa mina ngizalitshaya ngemichilo elameva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu babuya kuRehobowamu ngosuku lwesithathu njengokutsho kwakhe ukuthi: Libuye kimi futhi ngosuku lwesithathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yabaphendula ngolaka abantu, yadela iseluleko sabadala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yalandela esamajaha yathi: Ubaba walethwesa ubunzima, mina ngizakwengezelela kubo; walitshaya ngesiswepu, kodwa mina ngizalitshaya ngemichilo elameva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi kayibalalelanga abantu; ngoba lokhu kwenziwa yiNkosi uNkulunkulu ukuze igcwalise ilizwi layo eyayilikhulume ngoAhija waseShiloni kuJerobowamu indodana kaNebati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho bonke abakoIsrayeli bebona ukuthi inkosi kayibalaleli, bayiphendula bathi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uRehobowamu esefikile eJerusalema wabuthanisa bonke abakoJuda lesizwe sakoBenjamini, amadoda empi ayizinkulungwane ezilikhulu lamatshumi aficaminwembili ukuba alwe labakoIsrayeli ukubuyisa umbuso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.11.1+2CH.11.2+2CH.11.3+2CH.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Lan 11:1–4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ilizwi likaNkulunkulu lafika kuShemaya umuntu kaNkulunkulu lathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshela uRehobowamu indodana kaSolomoni, inkosi yakoJuda, labo bonke abantu bakoJuda labakoBenjamini labantu abaseleyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthi iNkosi ithi: Lingaphumi ukulwa lezihlobo zenu abantu bakoIsrayeli. Buyelani lonke emizini yenu, ngoba lokhu kuyintando yami. Basebelilalela ilizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu, babuyela emizini yabo njengokutsho kwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJerobowamu wasesakha iShekema entabeni zakoEfrayimi, wahlala khona; wasuka lapho wayakwakha iPenuweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJerobowamu wacabanga wathi: Umbuso uzabuyela endlini kaDavida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uba lababantu besiyanikela imihlatshelo ethempelini eJerusalema, inhliziyo zabo zizabuyela futhi enkosini yabo, uRehobowamu inkosi yakoJuda, bangibulale babuyele kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kokunakana ngalindaba wenza amathole amabili egolide, wathi ebantwini: Seliye kakhulu eJerusalema; khangelani, nampa onkulunkulu benu, Israyeli, abalikhupha eGibithe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 32:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasemisa elinye ithole eBetheli, lelinye walimisa koDani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kwaba yisono koIsrayeli; abantu baya eBetheli ukukhonza elakhona, bahamba ummango wonke besiya koDani ukukhonza elinye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakha lamathempeli endaweni eziphakemeyo zokukhonzela, wabeka abapristi ebantwini bonke ababengesiwo amaLevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJerobowamu wamisa umkhosi ngosuku lwetshumi lanhlanu lwenyanga yesificaminwembili onjengomkhosi owakoJuda, wanikela imihlatshelo phezu kwealtare. Wenza njalo eBetheli ehlabela amathole ayewenzile. Wabeka eBetheli abapristi endaweni eziphakemeyo zokukhonzela ayezenzile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
